"hacktoberfest","maven-server","npm-registry","vue"],"visibility":"public","forks":6255,"open_issues":2890,"watchers":52486,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/pulls/14726","html_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/14726","diff_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/14726.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/14726.patch","merged_at":"2021-04-08T22:25:57Z"},"body":"Implemented downloading of remote LFS files with a custom HTTP/Filesystem client. The [GIT LFS Client](https://git-lfs.github.com/) isn't flexible enough to integrate into the Gitea model.\r\n\r\nLFS is supported for migrations and mirrors files periodicaly if mirroring is enabled. The client respects file size limits set in the Gitea config and uses the internal LFS structure to store the files. The client determines the LFS endpoint from the clone url if not specified. Migration of local filesystem repositories is supported too. In case of a mirrored repository LFS support can be (de)activated later in the repository settings.\r\n\r\nMigration page:\r\n![migration](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1666336/111914304-b2c31900-8a71-11eb-842e-2e2fbae4fae7.gif)\r\n\r\nMigration of local repositories is supported:\r\n![local](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1666336/110678986-39a50580-81d7-11eb-87ce-1cdc3bd02733.png)\r\n\r\nRepository settings page:\r\n![settings](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1666336/110677670-b6cf7b00-81d5-11eb-9ff3-ac4eb41f3587.png)\r\n\r\nToDo:\r\n- [x] restructured code into clean `modules` / `services` seperation\r\n- [x] file size restrictions on import\r\n- [x] add support for custom LFS servers\r\n- [x] add support for local filesystem repositories\r\n- [x] integrate into ui\r\n- [x] integrate into clone\r\n- [x] integrate into mirror update\r\n- [x] remember custom LFS server in mirror\r\n- [x] manage LFS settings from repository settings page\r\n- [x] use authentication\r\n- [ ] ~use different credentials~ should be implemented with #14483\r\n\r\nclose #14718\r\nclose #849","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/14726/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":5,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/14726/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":4453769176,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDQ0NTM3NjkxNzY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/events/4453769176","actor":{"login":"noerw","id":7880552,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODA1NTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7880552?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/noerw","html_url":"https://github.com/noerw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noerw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noerw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noerw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noerw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noerw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noerw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noerw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noerw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noerw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-03-13T12:05:54Z","label":{"name":"kind/bug","color":"ee0701"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":4454149390,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDQ0NTQxNDkzOTA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/events/4454149390","actor":{"login":"zeripath","id":1824502,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjQ1MDI=","avatar_url":"https: